# Use a CLASSIC token, not a fine-grained one: most orgs reject fine-grained
# PATs with a lifetime over 366 days, so every release in those orgs 403s and
# silently vanishes from the page. Reading public releases needs no scopes at
# all; read:org is only needed to discover org repos you belong to.
# Create one: https://github.com/settings/tokens/new?description=releases.antfu.me&scopes=read:org
GITHUB_TOKEN=your_token
GITHUB_LOGIN=antfu
GITHUB_NAME=Anthony Fu
WEBSITE_DOMAIN=https://releases.antfu.me
